<Base title="API keys — Plinth" path="/docs/api-keys">
  <p class="land-band">API keys</p>
  <h1>API keys</h1>
  <article class="plot-window prose">
    <p>Keys look like <code class="inline-code">pln_live_…</code>. Send as <code class="inline-code">x-plinth-key</code> or <code class="inline-code">Authorization: Bearer</code>.</p>
    <p>Anonymous requests are rate-limited by IP. Paid entitlements attach to the user who owns the key via Polar webhooks.</p>
    <p>Claim a key after checkout at <a href="/start">/start</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
